# =============================================================================
# 30-theming-fonts.list.chroot - icons, fonts and rendering support for Nimbus Dark
# =============================================================================
# What: the icon theme and fonts the Nimbus Dark theme and the Control Center
#       use, plus SVG support for wallpapers, icons and installer artwork.
# Why:  spec section 1 (Nimbus Dark theme). The theme itself ships in
#       nimbusos-branding. The Control Center serves Inter and JetBrains Mono
#       straight from these Debian packages, so their OFL license stays with
#       Debian (docs/PLAN.md NOTE-13).
# Format rules: see 10-base.list.chroot.
# =============================================================================

# Icons and cursors
papirus-icon-theme
breeze-cursor-theme

# Fonts: Inter for the interface, JetBrains Mono for code, paths and numbers
fonts-inter
fonts-jetbrains-mono

# SVG rendering: Qt 6 image plugin (Plasma, SDDM, Calamares) and the GTK loader
qt6-svg-plugins
librsvg2-common

# Text rendering in the Plymouth boot splash (passphrase prompt)
plymouth-label
